   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Ten new letters",
   "texto": [
    "These don't look like ours, so they don't fool: just learn them.",
    "**Б** is **b**. **Г** sounds like **g** of «cat»; in front of **е** and **и**, the consonant is softened. **Д** is **d**. **З** is a **z sonora**, with a buzzing, like «s» of «Same». **Л** is **l**. **П** is **p**. **Ф** is **f**.",
    "**И** is **i**. **Й** is a **i corta**, like «and» of «Today». **Э** is an open **e**, like the Spanish one."
   ]
  },
