  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "In the end they turn off.",
   "texto": [
    "At the end of the word, sound consonants lose their voice: **б** sounds «p», **г** sounds «k», **д** sounds «t» and **з** sounds «s».",
    "That's why **друг** (friend) is said «druk» and **город** (city), «górat»."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "This is",
   "texto": [
    "In these presentation phrases, **это** means «This is», «This is» or «This is» and remains the same: **Это дом** (this is a house), **это мама** (this is mom).",
    "To ask where: **Где?** **Где банк?** = where is the bank?",
    "**И** = y. **Или** = o."
   ]
